# Revisions to skip when running `git blame`.
#
# Only bulk, behaviour-preserving reformatting commits belong here — never a
# commit that also changes behaviour, because blame would then hide the real
# author of a real change.
#
# Enable locally (once per clone):
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Add one full 40-character SHA per line, with the commit subject as a comment
# above it. Short SHAs are rejected by git.

